{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他不想再等到心里全明白，先把自己能做的一份接下来。\",\n      \"key\": \"能做的一份\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"text\": \"没把握时，他仍带着疑虑尽力，不再反复问值不值，越投入越有力量，也越觉得痛快，多少有些骄傲。\",\n      \"key\": \"带着疑虑尽力\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\", \"B3\", \"B5\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-6\",\n      \"text\": \"心里的不满总算有了去处，他想把能给的都给出去，暂时顾不上反复琢磨自己，也不因一点软弱停下。\",\n      \"key\": \"能给的都给出去\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\", \"B5\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他仍惦记着那些珍惜的东西，如今却不能像过去那样自然地拥有。\",\n      \"key\": \"珍惜的东西\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他努力让自己显得没事，越是强撑，越显出他其实很在意。\",\n      \"key\": \"显得没事\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-5\",\n      \"text\": \"可一想到仍放不下的事，刚撑起的劲又泄了，他越发焦急，始终安顿不下来。\",\n      \"key\": \"刚撑起的劲\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R10\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S02-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"保留内容，删除跨段箭头\",\n      \"why\": \"保留珍惜之物仍被惦记、却不能再自然拥有的事实。S01-2只写害怕投入后失去别的东西，不足以解释这些东西为何已不能自然拥有，因此不再指向S02-3。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [],\n      \"now\": [\"S02-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留B4中努力维持挺立、悲伤仍在、越想控制越暴露在意的心理。改为努力让自己显得没事，不再把比喻落实成实际反复劝自己。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R10\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S02-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"删去重复开头\",\n      \"why\": \"删掉与S01-2硬撑着不肯垮下去重复的部分，只保留想到仍放不下的事后力量泄落、焦急难安的变化。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": [\n    {\n      \"bead\": \"B1\",\n      \"why\": \"前段只写了他害怕投入会失去别的东西，又说不清自己舍不得什么，没有交代这些珍惜之物为何已不能像从前那样自然拥有。只能保留这份失落，不能补出具体缘由。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "51cd0625-daf7-44d0-9989-f9ddf5754c1d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T003054106214Z", "elapsed_seconds": 121.375, "completed_utc": "2026-10-30T00:32:55.493362+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "2fb1218f0673727468957f46967b04998ebca4407b099d65099562df3d0413b5", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T003054106214Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha25